a directed cross-layer predictor that turns asymmetric source-to-sensitive transfer
failure into an anomaly score, with deep-to-sensitive channels as the principal signal and
shallow-to-sensitive channels as complementary evidence;

blocks.zh:
定向跨层预测器,将非对称源到敏感转移
以深至敏感频道作为主要信号
作为补充证据的浅至敏感渠道;

blocks.en:
With the same predictor architecture and training-only calibration, image AUROC is 99.75 99.75 on
MVTec-AD, 99.42 99.42 on VisA and 94.27 94.27 on Real-IAD. Real-IAD object-level AUROC is 96.26 96.26 ;
at 256 × 256 256\times 256 pixel resolution, P-AUROC/P-AUPRO is 99.26 / 96.59 99.26/96.59 .

blocks.zh:
具有同样的预测器架构和只训练校正,图像AUROC为 99.75 99.75
MVTec-AD,在VisA上的99.42 99.42,在Real-IAD上的94.27 94.27. Real-IAD 对象级 AUROC 为 96.26 96.26 ;
P-AUROC/P-AUPRO为99.26/96.59 99.26/96.59。
